                        ],
                        "form": "доли́нах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a48d8126-30e5-33cb-b45c-f7aeb3cfa3cf",
                        "entry_id": "33418b4a-e451-3eb4-a8ed-69abfc106259",
                        "glosses": [
                            "геогр. продолговатая впадина вдоль русла реки или между гор"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0678567d-63fb-4e4d-9d94-affc67e20a76",
                                "sense_id": "a48d8126-30e5-33cb-b45c-f7aeb3cfa3cf",
                                "text": "Выше полосы прибоя берег вздымался гранёными уступами, с густым зелёным ковром по распахнутым вверх склонам ущелий и неглубоких долин."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "68609363-0cda-3134-a7a9-747c8e9a4fcb",
                        "entry_id": "33418b4a-e451-3eb4-a8ed-69abfc106259",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. особая зона в структуре полупроводника"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d39ffe35-6ba2-4130-b403-0b8e52c36ff5",
                                "sense_id": "68609363-0cda-3134-a7a9-747c8e9a4fcb",
                                "text": "Эффект Ганна наблюдается главным образом в двухдолинных полупроводниках, зона проводимости которых состоит из одной нижней долины и нескольких верхних долин."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "558e2a8d-ccea-4349-adc4-4d83e295328d",
                        "source_entry_id": "33418b4a-e451-3eb4-a8ed-69abfc106259",
                        "source_sense_description": "впадина",
                        "target_lang_word": "valley",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "valley",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57c92048-fa5d-3deb-8be1-d142616ab787",
                                        "entry_id": "88ae41ec-3ac4-362f-8bf9-35aecd26b606",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An elongated depression cast between hills or mountains, often with a river flowing through it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba5498a8-7c58-48d6-9ec6-d7f2f30fe4ba",
                                                "sense_id": "57c92048-fa5d-3deb-8be1-d142616ab787",
                                                "text": "The Indus River valley was the site of an ancient civilization."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36311bce-732a-4f09-987d-e0744e958459",
                                                "sense_id": "57c92048-fa5d-3deb-8be1-d142616ab787",
                                                "text": "[I]t sank down through the air and poured over the ground in a manner rather liquid than gaseous, abandoning the hills, and streaming into the valleys and ditches and water-courses even as I have heard the carbonic acid gas that pours from volcanic clefts is wont to do."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60ddd753-8e92-448b-9d0d-dcec0d9e4d55",
                                                "sense_id": "57c92048-fa5d-3deb-8be1-d142616ab787",
                                                "text": "The El Dorado-Searchlight area is geologically a north-south trending orogenous zone, paralleled on the east by the valley of the Colorado, and by an alluvial valley on the west."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c3be8dd-91b2-4a82-8716-d2cecc6f4f1a",
                                                "sense_id": "57c92048-fa5d-3deb-8be1-d142616ab787",
                                                "text": "Most of the Himalayan rivers have been relatively untouched by dams near their sources. Now the two great Asian powers, India and China, are rushing to harness them as they cut through some of the world's deepest valleys."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b187139-5dde-3bbe-b711-c9a0d849fe12",
                                        "entry_id": "88ae41ec-3ac4-362f-8bf9-35aecd26b606",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area which drains itself into a river."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58b76710-9128-3ac8-91c3-254a98386098",
                                        "entry_id": "88ae41ec-3ac4-362f-8bf9-35aecd26b606",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any structure resembling one, e.g. the interior angle formed by the intersection of two sloping roof planes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "valley",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c27678e-b0a8-3c7d-a876-e36367080916",
                                        "entry_id": "7d1ddb11-0780-35d7-aed2-d2046e9e8d6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To form the shape of a valley."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "poetic",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "352e7a16-d02b-471d-abe2-3efca58e274b",
                                                "sense_id": "4c27678e-b0a8-3c7d-a876-e36367080916",
                                                "text": "These hues of red rose and green and pale green, ruffled and pouted in the billowy white of the dress ballooning and valleying softly, like a yacht before the sail bends low; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f315798d-d731-4688-8688-a84e64b1ff0b",
                                                "sense_id": "4c27678e-b0a8-3c7d-a876-e36367080916",
                                                "text": "Over Govino Bay, looking up from the water’s edge, the landscape resembles nothing so much as the hills above Genova, valleying into the sea, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23b784f3-566c-4842-b67e-3d513fdf4316",
                                                "sense_id": "4c27678e-b0a8-3c7d-a876-e36367080916",
                                                "text": "There must be something atavistic in the male blood that makes it rush, relent, rush with the peaks and the valleys, the roundness of Lia's breasts valleying and peaking, the stretch of her neck, the swaying of her hips."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7b5dab1-f60f-4eaf-bc35-96cb815be340",
                        "source_entry_id": "33418b4a-e451-3eb4-a8ed-69abfc106259",
                        "source_sense_description": "впадина",
                        "target_lang_word": "vale",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                        "entry_id": "74f033b6-2c87-34a1-9a0f-a864a4e9f2c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A valley."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c10d0a5d-edb9-4f4f-821b-0bd7956e6979",
                                                "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                                "text": "In those fair vales, by nature form'd to please, / Where Guadalquiver serpentines with ease,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c5c38ac-11e8-45c6-aa75-35579132444d",
                                                "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                                "text": "\"Make me a cottage in the vale,\" she said, / \"Where I may mourn and pray."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aae35c81-d789-4a6f-948e-150c31c12341",
                                                "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                                "text": "Beyond this vale of tears / There is a life above,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf52ee18-5d90-4146-9081-0020726d82dd",
                                                "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                                "text": "The short sweet turfage of the hills renders \"Portland mutton\" almost as famous as Welsh, while the luxuriance of the vales lends itself to the breeding of fine cattle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0238313a-b297-4639-9b47-50241d79206d",
                                                "sense_id": "00e58d41-cf3e-3c03-bedf-3988f9c9b8d4",
                                                "text": "But now a cry went up, passing up the wind from the south from vale to vale, and Elves and Men lifted their voices in wonder and joy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "vale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f469154f-7c84-3eab-b4da-4fa6f954cb75",
                                        "entry_id": "1066c2c2-f6ef-30d0-807f-338a864a3c31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Farewell."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
